msgid "Architecture Tour: Building the Robotics Application"
msgstr "Architecture Tour: Robotics Application 구성"

msgid ""
"Camera orbit around the stationary SO-101 simulated workstation, with vials and rack inside the "
"lightbox."
msgstr "Lightbox 안의 vial과 rack, 고정된 SO-101 simulation workstation을 camera가 둘러보는 모습입니다."

msgid ""
"We've collected demonstrations in simulation. Now let's look at the code that makes that "
"possible, before we evaluate a policy."
msgstr "Simulation에서 demonstration을 수집했습니다. Policy 평가에 앞서 이를 가능하게 하는 code를 살펴봅니다."

msgid "Learning Objectives"
msgstr "학습 목표"

msgid "**Explain** how Omniverse libraries, Newton, Isaac Lab, and LeRobot work together."
msgstr "Omniverse libraries, Newton, Isaac Lab, LeRobot이 함께 동작하는 방식 **설명**"

msgid "**Describe** how a robot learning simulation environment is structured."
msgstr "Robot learning simulation environment의 구조 **설명**"

msgid ""
"**Trace** how configuration, sensors, reset events, observations, and recording connect in one "
"control loop."
msgstr "하나의 control loop에서 configuration, sensor, reset event, observation, recording이 연결되는 과정 **추적**"

msgid "How the Pieces Fit Together"
msgstr "구성 요소의 연결"

msgid ""
"We're building a custom robotics application with **Omniverse libraries, Newton, Isaac Lab, and "
"LeRobot**. These libraries give you the building blocks to build the application you need. Here, "
"we combine them for our robot, task, and learning workflow."
msgstr ""
"**Omniverse libraries, Newton, Isaac Lab, LeRobot**으로 custom robotics application을 만듭니다. 각 "
"library는 필요한 application을 구성하는 기반을 제공하며, 여기서는 robot, task, learning workflow에 맞게 조합합니다."

msgid ""
"Workshop code connects LeRobot to Isaac Lab, which uses Newton physics and Omniverse rendering "
"with USD assets. Joint state and camera images return as observations."
msgstr ""
"Workshop code가 LeRobot과 Isaac Lab을 연결합니다. Isaac Lab은 Newton physics와 USD asset 기반 Omniverse "
"rendering을 사용하며, joint state와 camera image를 observation으로 반환합니다."

msgid "Component"
msgstr "구성 요소"

msgid "What it does in this workshop"
msgstr "이 Workshop에서의 역할"

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "**Omniverse libraries**"
msgstr "**Omniverse libraries**"

msgid ""
"ovstage manages the USD scene used for rendering, and ovrtx renders the wrist and external camera"
" images. USD assets describe the robot, rack, vials, and lightbox."
msgstr ""
"ovstage는 rendering용 USD scene을 관리하고, ovrtx는 wrist와 external camera image를 렌더링합니다. USD asset은 "
"robot, rack, vial, lightbox를 정의합니다."

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "**Newton**"
msgstr "**Newton**"

msgid ""
"Advances the physics: robot motion, gravity, and contacts between the gripper, vials, and rack. "
"This application uses its MJWarp solver."
msgstr ""
"Robot motion, gravity, gripper·vial·rack 사이의 contact 등 physics를 계산합니다. 이 application에서는 MJWarp "
"solver를 사용합니다."

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "**Isaac Lab**"
msgstr "**Isaac Lab**"

msgid ""
"Organizes the scene, actions, observations, reset events, and conditions that end an episode. It "
"connects the physics and rendering backends to the task."
msgstr ""
"Scene, action, observation, reset event, episode 종료 조건을 구성하고 physics 및 rendering backend를 task와 "
"연결합니다."

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "**LeRobot**"
msgstr "**LeRobot**"

msgid ""
"Provides robot and teleoperator interfaces, the demonstration dataset format, and policy training"
" and inference tools. The workshop bridge converts between LeRobot joint values and simulation "
"actions."
msgstr ""
"Robot 및 teleoperator interface, demonstration dataset format, policy 학습 및 inference 도구를 제공합니다. "
"Workshop bridge가 LeRobot joint value와 simulation action 사이를 변환합니다."

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "**Workshop code**"
msgstr "**Workshop code**"

msgid ""
"Defines the vial-to-rack task, connects teleoperation or a policy to the arm, records "
"demonstrations, and reports evaluation results."
msgstr "Vial-to-rack task를 정의하고 teleoperation 또는 policy를 arm에 연결하며, demonstration 기록과 평가 결과 보고를 수행합니다."

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "Isaac Lab Environment Configuration"
msgstr "Isaac Lab Environment Configuration"

msgid ""
"In Isaac Lab, a registered task identifies the configuration used to create a simulation "
"environment. The `--task` flag selects which environment to load."
msgstr ""
"Isaac Lab의 등록된 task는 simulation environment 생성에 사용할 configuration을 지정합니다. `--task` flag로 "
"environment를 선택합니다."

msgid ""
"These examples are **pseudocode**: they simplify class names, observation groups, and return "
"values to show the architecture, rather than provide runnable scripts."
msgstr ""
"다음 예시는 **pseudocode**입니다. 실행용 script가 아니라 architecture를 설명하기 위해 class name, observation group, "
"return value를 단순화했습니다."

msgid "Environment configuration connects scene, simulation, and managers to the reset and step loop."
msgstr "Environment configuration이 scene, simulation, manager를 reset 및 step loop에 연결합니다."

msgid ""
"Rewards are part of the environment interface; recording demonstrations does not use them to "
"update a policy."
msgstr "Reward는 environment interface의 일부지만, demonstration recording에서는 policy update에 사용하지 않습니다."

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "Camera Sensor"
msgstr "Camera Sensor"

msgid ""
"The camera configuration selects image size, channels, update timing, and renderer. ovrtx renders"
" the scene, and the images become observations for the policy or recorder."
msgstr ""
"Camera configuration은 image 크기, channel, update timing, renderer를 선택합니다. ovrtx가 scene을 렌더링하고 "
"image는 policy 또는 recorder의 observation이 됩니다."

msgid ""
"Camera configuration and ovrtx rendering feed camera images into observations during the "
"environment loop."
msgstr "Environment loop에서 camera configuration과 ovrtx rendering을 거쳐 camera image가 observation으로 전달됩니다."

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "**Source:** `source/sim_to_real_so101/tasks/task_env_cfg.py`"
msgstr "**Source:** `source/sim_to_real_so101/tasks/task_env_cfg.py`"

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "Reset Terms"
msgstr "Reset Terms"

msgid ""
"A reset event calls a function with its configured parameters. Here, the reset function varies "
"rack placement. It runs when an environment resets, rather than on every control step. The "
"example ranges are in meters for position and radians for yaw."
msgstr ""
"Reset event는 설정한 parameter로 함수를 호출합니다. 여기서는 rack 배치를 변화시킵니다. 매 control step이 아니라 environment "
"reset 시 실행되며, 예시 range의 position 단위는 meter, yaw는 radian입니다."

msgid ""
"Initial reset or episode ending triggers rack and vial randomization; normal steps continue "
"without resetting."
msgstr "초기 reset이나 episode 종료 시 rack과 vial을 randomize하고, 일반 step은 reset 없이 이어집니다."

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "**Source:** `source/sim_to_real_so101/tasks/vials_to_rack_env_cfg.py`"
msgstr "**Source:** `source/sim_to_real_so101/tasks/vials_to_rack_env_cfg.py`"

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "Grasp Observation"
msgstr "Grasp Observation"

msgid ""
"Observation terms can turn sensor readings into useful task signals. The workshop combines "
"contact force with vial height to estimate whether a vial is grasped, then keeps that flag while "
"contact persists. This is a progress signal, not proof of a stable grasp or successful placement."
msgstr ""
"Observation term은 sensor reading을 유용한 task signal로 바꿉니다. Workshop에서는 contact force와 vial height를 "
"조합해 grasp 여부를 추정하고, contact가 유지되는 동안 flag를 유지합니다. 이는 진행 상황 signal이며 안정적인 grasp나 placement 성공을 "
"증명하지는 않습니다."

msgid ""
"The observation manager uses contact sensor data to compute the vial-grasped signal for the "
"running loop."
msgstr "Observation manager가 contact sensor data를 사용해 실행 중인 loop의 vial-grasped signal을 계산합니다."

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "LeRobot Recorder"
msgstr "LeRobot Recorder"

msgid ""
"During teleoperation, the leader supplies the action. Record the current images and joint state "
"with that action **before** advancing simulation, so each observation is paired with the command "
"applied next. The bridge separates simulation actions (radians) from dataset actions (arm degrees"
" and gripper percent). It also converts observed joint state into dataset units before recording."
msgstr ""
"Teleoperation에서는 leader가 action을 제공합니다. Simulation을 진행하기 **전에** 현재 image와 joint state를 해당 action과"
" 함께 기록해 observation과 다음 명령이 짝을 이루도록 합니다. Bridge는 simulation action(radian)과 dataset action(arm "
"degree 및 gripper percent)을 구분하고, 관측된 joint state도 기록 전에 dataset 단위로 변환합니다."

msgid ""
"Read a leader action, record it with current joint state and camera images, then step the "
"environment and pace the next iteration."
msgstr ""
"Leader action을 읽고 현재 joint state 및 camera image와 함께 기록한 뒤, environment step을 진행하고 다음 반복의 timing을 "
"맞춥니다."

msgid "**Pseudocode — illustrates the recording sequence.**"
msgstr "**Pseudocode — Recording 순서를 설명합니다.**"

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "**Source:** `source/sim_to_real_so101/scripts/lerobot_agent.py`"
msgstr "**Source:** `source/sim_to_real_so101/scripts/lerobot_agent.py`"

msgid "Follow One Control Step"
msgstr "하나의 Control Step 따라가기"

msgid ""
"Now trace how these building blocks work together in one control loop iteration. Start from "
"`lerobot_agent.py`, called with the `--task` flag that selects the environment."
msgstr ""
"한 번의 control loop에서 구성 요소가 어떻게 함께 동작하는지 따라가 보세요. `--task` flag로 environment를 선택해 호출하는 "
"`lerobot_agent.py`에서 시작합니다."

msgid ""
"During teleoperation, the leader supplies a command through the LeRobot interface, and the "
"workshop bridge converts it to simulation joint commands. When recording is active, the recorder "
"pairs the current camera images and joint state with the command about to be applied, in LeRobot "
"format. Then `env.step(actions)` advances Newton physics through Isaac Lab, ovrtx renders the "
"cameras, and Isaac Lab returns the observations for the next iteration."
msgstr ""
"Teleoperation에서는 leader가 LeRobot interface로 명령을 제공하고 workshop bridge가 simulation joint command로 "
"변환합니다. Recording 중에는 현재 camera image 및 joint state를 곧 적용할 명령과 함께 LeRobot format으로 기록합니다. 이후 "
"`env.step(actions)`가 Isaac Lab을 통해 Newton physics를 진행하고, ovrtx가 camera를 렌더링하며, Isaac Lab이 다음 반복의 "
"observation을 반환합니다."

msgid ""
"During policy evaluation, the policy supplies actions instead of the leader. The same simulation "
"scene and task checks tell us what happened."
msgstr "Policy 평가에서는 leader 대신 policy가 action을 제공합니다. 같은 simulation scene과 task 검사를 사용해 결과를 확인합니다."

msgid "What's Next?"
msgstr "다음 단계"

msgid ""
"Continue to [Learning From Real Demonstrations With a State Machine](09-state-machine-"
"learning.md) to explore automated collection guided by human examples."
msgstr ""
"[Learning From Real Demonstrations With a State Machine](09-state-machine-learning.md)에서 사람의 예시를 "
"활용한 자동 수집을 살펴보세요."

